pi-kiro-api
===========

This package contains source code derived from pi-kiro:

  https://github.com/hongyilyu/pi-kiro
  Copyright (c) 2026 Hongyi Lyu
  Licensed under the MIT License.

The following files under src/kiro/ are adapted from pi-kiro's `src/`:

  debug.ts           — verbatim, prefix renamed
  tokenizer.ts       — verbatim
  event-parser.ts    — verbatim, import path updated
  thinking-parser.ts — verbatim, import path updated
  transform.ts       — adapted: origin changed to AI_EDITOR (KIRO_ORIGIN)
  models.ts          — adapted: API-key base URL, added Claude Opus 4.8
  stream.ts          — adapted: API-key auth header/origin, OAuth profileArn
                       pre-flight lookup removed

The original pi-kiro MIT license text is reproduced below.

